# Shape: shunt capacitor with control. LinearShuntCompensator + RegulatingControl monitoring a Terminal
# declared earlier (generated: <equipment>_T<n>, here the line the control watches, as an OpenDSS
# CapControl element=line.j1). The control delay is the compensator's aVRDelay.
# A control watching the capacitor's own terminal cannot be written yet: the compensator references the
# control and RegulatingControl.RegulatingCondEq is not a column (CIMTABLES_REQUESTS R11).

Profile = cim18v17

Import common.cimtbl

Object LoadBreakSwitch: mRID=sw_j1, name=j1, node1=n1, node2=n10, phases=ABC, open=false, normalOpen=false, BaseVoltage=bv_4p16kv, EquipmentContainer=fdr_shapes
Object RegulatingControl: mRID=cap_c1_ctrl, name=c1_ctrl, mode=voltage, discrete=true, enabled=true, monitoredPhase=A, targetValue (V)=2225, targetDeadband (V)=550, ptRatio=1, Terminal=sw_j1_T1
Object LinearShuntCompensator: mRID=cap_c1, name=c1, node=n10, phases=ABC, phaseConnection=Y, grounded=true, nomQ (kVAr)=600, nomU (kV)=4.16, bPerSection (S)=0.0346709, sections=1, normalSections=1, maximumSections=1, aVRDelay (s)=15, controlEnabled=true, RegulatingControl=cap_c1_ctrl, BaseVoltage=bv_4p16kv, EquipmentContainer=fdr_shapes
